---
import { Bike, ShoppingBag, Check, ArrowRight, MapPin, Clock } from '@lucide/astro';
---

<section id="modalidades" class="relative z-20 rounded-t-[36px] lg:rounded-t-[48px] bg-white pt-16 pb-20 px-6 lg:px-12 text-[#2B2D33] shadow-2xl">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl">
    
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-normal tracking-tight text-[#0B2545]">
        Automatización para tus dos canales de mayor venta
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-[#5C616B]">
        Precyza optimiza la experiencia tanto para los clientes que piden a domicilio como para los que retiran en mostrador.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Dual Cards (HackerRank Choose Your Adventure style) -->
    <div class="mt-14 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      
      <!-- Card 1: Delivery Propio -->
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-between rounded-[28px] bg-[#071527] p-8 lg:p-10 text-white shadow-xl border border-white/8 relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-[#0FA968]/40 transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="absolute -top-24 -right-24 h-48 w-48 rounded-full bg-[#0FA968]/20 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="inline-flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-warp-emerald text-white shadow-md">
              <Bike class="h-6 w-6" />
            </div>
            <span class="rounded-full bg-white/10 px-3.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-[#26C281] border border-white/10">
              Delivery 24/7
            </span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="mt-6 text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-normal text-white">
            Para Delivery a Domicilio
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#F4F5F7]/80">
            Toma de pedidos sin colas de espera en WhatsApp. El agente solicita dirección, referencia, ubicación GPS y suma la tarifa de delivery de forma automática.
          </p>

          <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-[14px] text-[#F4F5F7]/90">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <Check class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-[#26C281] mt-0.5" />
              <span>Cero ambigüedad en direcciones y referencias de entrega.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <Check class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-[#26C281] mt-0.5" />
              <span>Verificación de Pago Móvil antes de encender fogones y despachar.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <Check class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-[#26C281] mt-0.5" />
              <span>Comanda directa con datos del motorizado y ticket de empaque.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-white/10">
          <a
            href="#piloto"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-white/10 px-6 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white hover:bg-[#0FA968] transition-colors"
          >
            <span>Postular para Delivery</span>
            <ArrowRight class="h-4 w-4" />
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: Pick Up (Retiro en Local) -->
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-between rounded-[28px] bg-[#071527] p-8 lg:p-10 text-white shadow-xl border border-white/8 relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-[#D9622B]/40 transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="absolute -top-24 -right-24 h-48 w-48 rounded-full bg-[#D9622B]/20 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="inline-flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-warp-orange text-white shadow-md">
              <ShoppingBag class="h-6 w-6" />
            </div>
            <span class="rounded-full bg-white/10 px-3.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-[#E58051] border border-white/10">
              Cero Colas en Caja
            </span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="mt-6 text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-normal text-white">
            Para Pick Up / Retiro en Local
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#F4F5F7]/80">
            El cliente pide y paga desde su casa o su auto antes de llegar. Tu cocina prepara la orden y el cliente solo muestra su número de comanda en el mostrador.
          </p>

          <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-[14px] text-[#F4F5F7]/90">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <Check class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-[#E58051] mt-0.5" />
              <span>Erradica las aglomeraciones y colas de clientes para pagar.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <Check class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-[#E58051] mt-0.5" />
              <span>Cobro asegurado de antemano (cero pedidos abandonados).</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <Check class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-[#E58051] mt-0.5" />
              <span>Despacho ágil en menos de 60 segundos por cliente.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-white/10">
          <a
            href="#piloto"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-white/10 px-6 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white hover:bg-[#D9622B] transition-colors"
          >
            <span>Postular para Pick Up</span>
            <ArrowRight class="h-4 w-4" />
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
